60,3,1,talk,May,,"Option C is a total no-go for me. It just cements the burden on one person's gate while we all pay for a ""fix"" that might just smell. Option A is the only one that's actually fair.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,"@May, I agree that Option C is risky. Given the smell issues I saw at the station block, a permanent structure could become a hygiene nightmare in August. However, Option A just shifts the nuisance around.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Kenji,,"@May, @Mizuki, I'm worried about Option C too! Even with the subsidy, it's way too expensive for some of us. But Option A sounds like a lot of moving stuff. What about the costs for Option B?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""May"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Midori,,"@Kenji, Option B might seem easier, but I'm worried about the ""overseeing"" part. If we have to police each other's bags, it could lead to the same friction we've seen before. We need a peaceful solution.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Servas,,"@Midori, you touch upon a vital truth. Option B requires a vigilance that often turns into a burden for the most conscientious. Option C, with its endless paperwork and early hours, is a heavy yoke. I favor Option A.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,May,,"@Servas, I'm glad we agree! @Mizuki, shifting the nuisance is exactly the point—it's better to share the annoyance than to let one person suffer for years. It's the only way to be truly equal.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@May, sharing the burden is fair, but we must be honest: we aren't removing the nuisance, just rotating it. Still, compared to a smelly shelter or the social tension of policing each other, it is the most logical choice.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Kenji,,"@May, @Mizuki, if you both like Option A, I'm in too! It's way cheaper than building a shelter, and we won't have to worry about anyone struggling to pay a huge bill. Let's go with that!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""May"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Midori,,"@Kenji, @May, @Mizuki, if you all feel that Option A is the fairest, I will support it too. As long as we handle the rotation with kindness, it's better than arguing over rules.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""May"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Servas,,"It is heartening to see such unity. By choosing to share the burden, we ensure that no single neighbor is worn down by a duty that never ends. Let us move forward with a light spirit. I vote for Option A.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,May,,I'm glad we're all on the same page. It's the only option that doesn't just pretend the problem is gone while leaving one person stuck with it. I vote for Option A!,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree. While not perfect, it avoids the hygiene risks of a shelter and the social friction of supervision. It is the most sustainable and fair compromise. I vote for Option A.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Kenji,,I'm happy we all agree! It's the best way to keep things fair without making anyone pay too much money. I vote for Option A!,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Midori,,"I agree. Since we all feel this is the fairest way to share the burden without creating new conflicts or financial stress, I'll join you. I vote for Option A!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Servas,,"The circle is complete, and our hearts are in accord. By choosing to share the weight, we protect the peace of our neighborhood. I also cast my vote for Option A.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,May,,Perfect! We've actually managed to be fair and efficient. Let's just make sure the rotation schedule accounts for those narrow frontages so nobody gets stuck with a logistical nightmare. Glad we sorted this out!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
76,3,4,pass,May,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
77,3,4,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree, May. We should be mindful of the physical constraints during the planning. I'm glad we chose a path that avoids long-term hygiene issues and financial strain.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
78,3,4,pass,Mizuki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
79,3,4,talk,Kenji,,I'm just glad we didn't go with the expensive shelter! Now we can all keep our money and still be fair to each other. This was a great team effort!,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
80,3,4,pass,Kenji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
81,3,4,talk,Midori,,I'm so glad we could all agree. The most important thing is that we're doing this together and staying friends. I'm looking forward to a more peaceful lane for everyone.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
82,3,4,pass,Midori,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
83,3,4,talk,Servas,,"Indeed. When we walk together, the road becomes shorter and the burden lighter. May this agreement be a seed that grows into a deeper friendship for us all. Farewell for now.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
